{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe coach was comfortable, though the roads from Aachen to here were muddy. In Aachen I spent the entire morning and afternoon at Bettendorf’s house. He is a man of good taste and no small fortune; his collection of paintings is superb, far superior to what we see in the provincial galleries of Germany. I sat in Charlemagne’s actual coronation chair while the sexton explained the mechanics of the old empire. It is a strange sensation to sit in the seat of such power, feeling the weight of history not as abstraction, but as wood and leather.\n\nI then walked to Burtscheid and took a sulphur bath. It was hot and unpleasant, but I confess it loosened my joints, which have been stiff from the journey. I dined at the inn; the food was plain, but the wine was decent. I have paid all bills and am ready to continue.\n\nHow are the boys? I trust Immanuel is not neglecting his Latin. I am well, if tired.\n\nYour\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219328,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":221,"prompt_tokens":1122,"total_tokens":1343,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-yElToklXPMPggZ3a6Hxhg3n6xZ5K9Xir","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1122,"prompt_ms":1059.186,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9440160427807486,"prompt_per_second":1059.3040315865203,"predicted_n":221,"predicted_ms":5187.347,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.57885,"predicted_per_second":42.410889419967475}}